hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1706","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Quran parho jab tak tumhare dil us par mile hon. Phir jab ikhtilaf karo to us se uth jao."
"1707","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek mardon mein sab se na-pasandeeda sakht jhagda karne wala hai."
"1708","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum zaroor un ke tareeqon ki pairwi karoge jo tum se pehle they, balisht se balisht, hath se hath. Yahan tak ke agar wo goa ke bil mein dakhil hon to tum un ki pairwi karoge. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yahood aur Nasara? Aap ne farmaya: Phir kaun?"
"1709","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Qayamat ki alamaton mein se hai ke ilm uthaya jayega, jahalat sabit hogi, sharab pi jayegi, zina zahir hoga."
"1710","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Qayamat se pehle din hain jin mein ilm uthaya jayega, jahalat utregi, harj zyada hoga. Aur harj qatl hai."
"1711","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zamana qareeb hoga. Amal kam hoga. Kanjoosi dali jayegi. Fitne zahir honge. Harj zyada hoga. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo kaun sa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Qatl, qatl."
"1712","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah ilm ko kheench kar qabz nahi farmata, use bandon se kheenchta hai. Lekin ilm ko ulama ke qabz se qabz farmata hai. Yahan tak ke jab aalim na chhore to log jahil sardar banayenge. Phir un se poochha jayega. Phir wo baghair ilm ke fatwa denge. Phir gumrah honge aur gumrah karenge."
"1713","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhe. Aur main us ke sath hun jab wo mujhe yaad kare. Phir agar wo mujhe apne dil mein yaad kare to main use apne dil mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujhe majlis mein yaad kare to main use us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se balisht bhar qareeb ho to main us se hath bhar qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mujh se hath bhar qareeb ho to main us se phelay hath qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mere paas chal kar aaye to main us ke paas daud kar aata hun."
